      "quote": "If the services of a service provider are terminated by a bank, then it shall: (i) publicise the same so as to ensure that its customers do not continue to deal with the service provider; and (ii) inform Indian Banks' Association (IBA) of the reasons for termination to enable IBA to maintain a caution list of such service providers for sharing among banks."
